  "description": {
   "value": "<p><strong>Cost:</strong> 500eb (Expensive) <strong>♦</strong> <strong>Required Slots:</strong> 1</p>\n<p><strong>Fits:</strong> All Ranged Weapons capable of Autofire that expend 10 rounds when using Autofire, except Machine Guns</p>\n<p><em>By optimizing fire rate, ammo conservation becomes easy. Crucial for mercs on long-term assignments or punks with 6eb in their pocket.</em></p>\n<p>The weapon now only expends 6 rounds when using Autofire.</p>\n<p><em>NOTE: Credit to the Cyberpunk RUSH LC for the inspiration behind this item.</em></p>\n<p><strong>Attachment slots:</strong> 1</p>\n<p><em>From <a href=\"https://docs.google.com/document/d/13EnSAoiLDsC7zmL-Jr1RqIh_EnuVuFnExqiipDVquMk/edit\">Corgo's 77 Collection V3</a> by Corgopolis (Weapons &gt; Attachment Catalog &gt; Internal Components).</em></p>"
